*.pyc

# WebRTC/onnxruntime are fetched as remote SPM binaryTargets (see
# QAudionEngine/Package.swift) — never as local zips. Two orphaned zips
# (WebRTC-M147.zip, pod-onnxruntime-ext-0.13.0.zip, unreferenced anywhere
# in the repo) were swept in by an unrelated commit (730457d) via a broad
# `git add`; removed 2026-07-28. This guards against a repeat.
/WebRTC-M147.zip
/pod-onnxruntime-ext-0.13.0.zip
